<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Ro ghoul</Major>
    <Description>This is a roblox macro on a game called ro ghoul where u block everytime when u dash  left (A). Very helpful and with this u can block most of the attacks while dashing without stopping or breaking ur movement. U can use this with most kagune/quinque. To use this perfectly it can work on 100 ping and 60 fps +. If u want to use this macro u can do the following

1. Download the keyran program. 
2.download my macro. 
3. Open the keyran program. 
4.Get/Buy /Days/Months/Years/Centuries. 
5. Open the markos editor. 
6. Click open file. 7. choose my macro. 
8. Close the macro editor. 
9. Assign to any button. 
10. Open the game. 
11. Enjoy the game

</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 4 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyDown 23 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 23 1
Delay 30 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>